            "action": "commented",
            "text": "Ah yah, that makes sense; I haven't really figured out how to do road editing without breaking everything, so I'll give it a shot later, but no promises that I'll actually save any changes",
            "html": "<p dir=\"auto\">Ah yah, that makes sense; I haven't really figured out how to do road editing without breaking everything, so I'll give it a shot later, but no promises that I'll actually save any changes</p>"
